{"id":633,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Because it can’t see, this Pokémon is constantly biting at everything it touches, trying to keep track of its surroundings."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"When it encounters something, its first urge is usually to bite it. If it likes what it tastes, it will commit the associated scent to memory."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Lacking sight, it’s unaware of its surroundings, so it bumps into things and eats anything that moves."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White"],"text":"They cannot see, so they tackle and bite to learn about their surroundings. Their bodies are covered in wounds."},{"games":["Black"],"text":"It tends to bite everything, and it is not a picky eater. Approaching it carelessly is dangerous."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Hustle","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Attack stat but lowers its accuracy."}],"eggGroups":["Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":40,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"Blue","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":633,"name":"Deino","condition":null,"children":[{"id":634,"name":"Zweilous","condition":"Lv. 50","children":[{"id":635,"name":"Hydreigon","condition":"Lv. 64","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,116],[4,225],[8,44],[12,46],[16,372],[20,29],[24,526],[28,21],[32,242],[36,184],[40,406],[44,34],[48,304],[52,407],[56,417],[60,200]],"machine":[34,242,399,434,913,406,525,414,203,263,424,304,423,417,200,182,244,240,156,46,184,214,555,180,164,241,36,269,851,168,422,86,428],"egg":[310,562,458,457],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"rsv10pt5-146","name":"Deino","set":"White Flare","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"146","artist":"Teeziro","img":"rsv10pt5/146"},{"id":"me55-97","name":"Deino","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Common","number":"97","artist":"Gapao","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-97/small","large":"https://images